ame="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-741702086"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 4, 2013 at 12:20 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7450936640390579987</id><published>2013-06-03T22:19:07.796-06:00</published><updated>2013-06-03T22:19:07.796-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Great read.  The refreshing thing is that there ar...</title><content type='html'>Great read.  The refreshing thing is that there are people &amp;quot;out there&amp;quot; who see through this BS and understand that they&amp;#39;re being lied to constantly.  On the flip side there are countless morons who actually believe the lies.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/352458775252466313/comments/default/7450936640390579987'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/352458775252466313/comments/default/7450936640390579987'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/06/the-fbi-american-cheka.html?showComment=1370319547796#c7450936640390579987' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/06/the-fbi-american-cheka.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-352458775252466313' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/352458775252466313' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-654530716"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 3, 2013 at 10:19 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2482145828564042069</id><published>2013-06-03T21:09:24.978-06:00</published><updated>2013-06-03T21:09:24.978-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I was a sting target in 93. The feds tried to trap...</title><content type='html'>I was a sting target in 93. The feds tried to trap a lawyer who referred me business from time to time but he didn&amp;#39;t  know enough about bankruptcy to commit the fraud they dreamed up so they told him to refer the agent to a bankruptcy specialist - me. Their plot was amateur. File BK but leave a million in real estate off the schedules. I told them that sounded illegal and I wasn&amp;#39;t  interested. They finally talked the first guy into giving it a try and then caged him at age 72. Apparently they peter the hell out of ya.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/352458775252466313/comments/default/2482145828564042069'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/352458775252466313/comments/default/2482145828564042069'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/06/the-fbi-american-cheka.html?showComment=1370315364978#c2482145828564042069' title=''/><author><name>farmarchist</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/06/the-fbi-american-cheka.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-352458775252466313' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/352458775252466313' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1251768081"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 3, 2013 at 9:09 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3286069384228511848</id><published>2013-06-03T15:26:16.985-06:00</published><updated>2013-06-03T15:26:16.985-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The state always has its own gangs. Luckily they a...</title><content type='html'>The state always has its own gangs. Luckily they are color coded with blue and black so you don&amp;#39;t have any run ins with them and end up black and blue. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/352458775252466313/comments/default/3286069384228511848'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/352458775252466313/comments/default/3286069384228511848'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/06/the-fbi-american-cheka.html?showComment=1370294776985#c3286069384228511848' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/06/the-fbi-american-cheka.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-352458775252466313' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/352458775252466313' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-741702086"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 3, 2013 at 3:26 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7836811687955877700</id><published>2013-06-03T14:59:28.491-06:00</published><updated>2013-06-03T14:59:28.491-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The KGB----FBI----must be abolished.&#xa;&#xa;Great post, ...</title><content type='html'>The KGB----FBI----must be abolished.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Great post, Will.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/352458775252466313/comments/default/7836811687955877700'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/352458775252466313/comments/def